0..76 Comment "// This source shows a comparison in a stated type that the checker decodes."
77..126 Comment "// The comparison\'s call omits its model of `Eq`."
127..129 Comment "//"
130..206 Comment "// A type that decodes a code compares two values to choose the code. So the"
207..272 Comment "// decode runs the comparison before the checker judges the body."
273..275 Comment "//"
276..351 Comment "// The operands\' sort decides the model before the checker judges the body."
352..427 Comment "// So the decode of the stated type runs the comparison, as a path endpoint"
428..439 Comment "// runs it."
440..442 Comment "//"
443..482 Comment "// - see: #6158 — `pathed`, `written`"
483..592 Comment "// - see: `../../pathological/modules/model-stated-type.gandr` — a slot that the signature leaves undecided"
